&lt;h2 id="july-18-forum-4">July 18: Forum 4&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Forum 4, &amp;ldquo;An Open and Collaborative Transport Innovation Ecosystem,&amp;rdquo; took place on the morning of July 18. Organized by the Guangzhou Transport Planning Research Institute Co., Ltd. and Tongji University, the forum brought together discussions on transport integration, data governance, and intelligent tool development, with particular attention to openness, technology sharing, and cross-sector collaboration in the digital era.&lt;/p>
